  "definition": "Deer Season",
  "effectiveDate": "2025-07-10",
  "expirationDate": "2035-07-10",
  "historyNote": "#1578, eff 5-12-80; ss by #1758, eff 5-29-81; ss by #2119, eff 8-12-82; ss by #2392, eff 6-22-83; ss by #2832, eff 8-21-84; ss by #3140, eff 10-25-85; amd by #4094, eff 7-22-86; ss by #4295, eff 7-21-87; ss by #4436, eff 6-20-88; ss by #4649, eff 7-24-89; amd by #4686, eff 10-24-89; ss by #4855, eff 7-3-90; ss by #5197, eff 8-2-91; ss by #5410, eff6-19-92; amd by #5659, eff 6-28-93; ss by #5706, eff9-21-93; ss by #5827, eff 5-24-94; amd by #5898, eff 9-20-94; amd by #6037, eff 5-17-95; ss by #6250, eff 5-22-96 (See Revision Note at part heading for Fis 301); ss by #6520, eff 5-31-97; ss by #6783, eff 6-30-98; ss by #7289, eff 6-1-00; ss by #7533, eff 7-24-01; ss by #7699, eff 6-5-02; ss by #7921, eff 7-24-03; ss by #8085, eff 5-26-04; ss by #8644, eff 6-1-06; ss by #8931, eff 7-6-07; ss by #9163, eff 5-28-08; amd by #9458, eff 4-21-09; amd by #9720-A, eff 6-5-10, (para (a)-(j), & (l) and (m)); amd by #9720-B, eff 6-5-10,(para (k)); ss by #10142, eff 6-5-12; ss by #10619, eff 6-2-14; ss by #11114, eff 6-3-16; ss by #12591, eff 7-25-18; ss by #13211, eff 5-26-21; ss by #13644, eff 6-1-23; ss by #14308, eff 7-10-25, EXPIRES: 7-10-35",
